flowchart LR
    Q[User request] --> CLASSIFY{Memory mode}
    CLASSIFY -->|Fresh task| FRESH[Clear old working context]
    CLASSIFY -->|Relevant/full| RECALL[Recall useful facts]
    FRESH --> PROMPT[Build prompt]
    RECALL --> PROMPT

    PROMPT --> WORKING[Working memory\ncurrent conversation]
    PROMPT --> CANON[Canonical memory\npreferences, projects, facts]
    PROMPT --> VECTOR[Vector recall\nsimilar meaning]
    PROMPT --> LESSONS[Lessons / experience\nwhat worked before]

    SAVE[Save new fact] --> CONFLICT{Conflict check}
    CONFLICT -->|New / trusted| STORE[(Canonical store)]
    CONFLICT -->|Old fact replaced| SUPERSEDE[Supersede old record]
    SUPERSEDE --> STORE

    ACTION[Tool proposal] --> POLICY[Policy engine]
    POLICY -->|Read-only| ALLOW[Allow]
    POLICY -->|High risk| CONFIRM[Ask user]
    POLICY -->|Unsafe resource / error| DENY[Deny]

    classDef memory fill:#dbeafe,stroke:#2563eb,color:#111827;
    classDef safety fill:#fee2e2,stroke:#dc2626,color:#111827;
    classDef store fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#d97706,color:#111827;
    class WORKING,CANON,VECTOR,LESSONS,RECALL,FRESH,PROMPT,CLASSIFY memory;
    class POLICY,ALLOW,CONFIRM,DENY,ACTION safety;
    class STORE,SUPERSEDE,CONFLICT store;
